If you mean translating the monster's names to another language,
that should be the easy part, since it is just a pointer in
the permonst struct. No code changes necessary there, other
than something to read in the changes from an appropriate text 
file.

For example, if you created a file called spanish.nh containing:
(my apologies to spanish speakers, I'm not one):

giant rat, rata
grid bug, insecto rejilla

and apply the following starter patch, you could define
the environment variable NHTRANSLATION_FILE to point to
spanish.nh and effectively change the name of those two 
monsters in the game.


